OL,3,GNEWSAGerry Kelly to contest Stormont
OL,4,Aelection after Sinn Fein 'approach'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinn Fein MLA Gerry Kelly has announced
OL,7,Fhe will seek re-election to the
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland Assembly in 2027,
OL,9,Fhaving previously decided not to stand.
OL,11,FThe North Belfast MLA said he had
OL,12,Freconsidered after being "approached"
OL,13,Fby his party.
OL,15,FKelly said he would put his name
OL,16,Fforward for selection as one of Sinn
OL,17,FFein's candidates in Belfast North.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
