OL,3,GNEWSAGerry Kelly to contest Stormont
OL,4,Aelection after Sinn Fein 'approach'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If elected, I will play my full part
OL,7,Fin the period ahead as part of the Sinn
OL,8,FFein team at the Assembly and working
OL,9,Fhard, on the ground, for the people of
OL,10,Fnorth Belfast," he added.
